WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Place a bolster lengthwise on the mat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit at one end and lie back over it.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arms open like a cactus or wide.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Stay soft and still.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Roll to the side to exit.
